English

This scope applies only to the author's separately licensable original HAT/IMU
circuit designs, PCB layouts, and original supporting design and build material.
Those parts use the existing Personal Non-Commercial License at:
../microduck-hd1910/LICENSES/Personal-NonCommercial.txt

Natural persons may use, modify and share the covered material without charge
for personal non-commercial learning, research and replication, subject to that
license's notice and attribution requirements. Commercial reproduction,
manufacturing, sale, product integration, paid services, distribution with paid
products, and organizational use require prior written permission from the
relevant rights holders. Personal installation and use of a purchased assembled
board require no additional authorization; this design-material license does
not change a lawful purchaser's statutory rights to use the product.

This is not a blanket license for hardware/, its third-party components, or
3d-print-frankenduck/. Upstream and other third-party designs, libraries,
firmware, models and community modifications retain their original licenses.
No previously validly granted rights are restricted or revoked. The author can
grant only rights they legally hold and are entitled to license separately;
this notice creates no exclusive rights beyond that legal scope.
